# 0.1.4 相对 0.1.3 的净变化；一条一行，格式「分类|语言|内容」
fixed|zh|写入可用 IP 落定后详情列表立即刷新：应用/还原共用同一条「落定即重读目录」链，失败原因顺带回显
fixed|en|The item list now refreshes as soon as an apply finishes: apply and restore share one "reload catalog on settle" chain, and failure reasons are surfaced
fixed|zh|清理弹框单条「重新检测」成功后重拉详情页结果，候选表不再停留在旧结论
fixed|en|A successful per-IP re-probe in the cleanup dialog now refreshes the detail results, so the candidate table no longer shows stale conclusions
